This distribution includes vocabulary derived from The Ontology Project
(T.O.P.), cr-domain, https://github.com/scientixai/the-ontology-project,
Apache-2.0. The file web/public/context/pne-context.jsonld is generated
from the T.O.P. cr-domain NGSI-LD context artifact plus a small demo
supplement (see infra/scripts/build-context.py).

The transform service uses sdtm.oak, the open-source CDISC/pharmaverse
SDTM transformation engine (https://github.com/pharmaverse/sdtm.oak),
installed from CRAN at container build time.

The architecture (an NGSI-LD broker fronting a CDISC clinical-research
pipeline) is inspired by the AWS Garnet Framework. This project does not
include, depend on, or deploy any Garnet code, images, or AWS services.
